      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DISTURBANCE (6) raced three wide without cover when he resumed with a fourth in the Tatlow Stakes at Menangle then drew on the back row and worked again but was too good in scoring by 3.4m at Penrith last week. Won over this distance the only time he raced here. Progressive colt who will be fitter again third up. Take beating. CHANGES (3) has been racing well, filling a top-three position in all four starts this time in. Led from wider for a 2.4m second most recently at this circuit and distance so has the speed to go forward from a good draw. PRETTY PRIVILEGE (1) steps up in grade but has put two wins together and should enjoy a soft run from the inside draw. WATTS UP WOODY (7) hasn't raced since he placed here six months ago but may have developed further with maturity and has been readied with two city trials, placing in his latest. Include at odds.",
